        <details><summary>How often does a Porsche need service?<span class="pl"></span></summary><div class="fa">Porsche alternates a minor service annually with a major service every 2 years / 20,000 miles that adds filters, spark plugs and brake fluid.</div></details>
        <details><summary>Do you service air-cooled and classic Porsches?<span class="pl"></span></summary><div class="fa">Yes — air-cooled 911 valve adjustments and Motul Classic oil service are a specialty, work many dealers no longer offer.</div></details>
